{"abstract":"In accordance with subsection (e)(12) of the Privacy Act of 1974, as amended, VA is providing notice of a re-established matching program between VA and the Department of Health and Human Services (HHS) Centers for Medicare & Medicaid Services (CMS) entitled \"Disclosure of Information to Support the Veterans Affairs' Seek to Prevent Fraud, Waste, and Abuse Initiative.\"","action":"Notice of a re-established matching program.","agencies":[{"id":520,"json_url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/api/v1/agencies/520","name":"Veterans Affairs Department","parent_id":null,"raw_name":"DEPARTMENT OF VETERANS AFFAIRS","slug":"veterans-affairs-department","url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/agencies/veterans-affairs-department"}],"body_html_url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/full_text/html/2022/04/01/2022-06908.html","cfr_references":[],"citation":"87 FR 19177","comment_url":null,"comments_close_on":"2022-05-02","correction_of":null,"corrections":[],"dates":"Comments on this matching program must be received no later than May 2, 2022. If no public comment is received during the period allowed for comment or unless otherwise published in the Federal Register by VA, the new agreement will become effective a minimum of 30 days after date of publication in the Federal Register. If VA receives public comments, VA shall review the comments to determine whether any changes to the notice are necessary. This matching program will be valid for 18 months from the effective date of this notice.","disposition_notes":null,"docket_ids":[],"dockets":[{"agency_name":"VA","documents":[{"allow_late_comments":null,"comment_count":1,"comment_end_date":"2022-05-03","comment_start_date":"2022-04-01","comment_url":"https://www.regulations.gov/commenton/VA-2022-VACO-0001-0156","id":"VA-2022-VACO-0001-0156","regulations_dot_gov_open_for_comment":false,"updated_at":"2023-02-28T12:21:10.814-05:00"}],"id":"VA-2022-VACO-0001","supporting_documents":[],"supporting_documents_count":0,"title":"Notices Requesting Comments"}],"document_number":"2022-06908","effective_on":null,"end_page":19178,"executive_order_notes":null,"executive_order_number":null,"full_text_xml_url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/full_text/xml/2022/04/01/2022-06908.xml","html_url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/2022/04/01/2022-06908/privacy-act-of-1974-matching-program","images":{},"images_metadata":{},"json_url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/api/v1/documents/2022-06908?publication_date=2022-04-01","mods_url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/metadata/granule/FR-2022-04-01/2022-06908/mods.xml","not_received_for_publication":null,"page_length":2,"page_views":{"count":205,"last_updated":"2026-10-23 08:15:04 -0400"},"pdf_url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2022-04-01/pdf/2022-06908.pdf","presidential_document_number":null,"proclamation_number":null,"public_inspection_pdf_url":"https://public-inspection.federalregister.gov/2022-06908.pdf?1648730729","publication_date":"2022-04-01","raw_text_url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/full_text/text/2022/04/01/2022-06908.txt","regulation_id_number_info":{},"regulation_id_numbers":[],"regulations_dot_gov_info":{"agency_id":"VA","checked_regulationsdotgov_at":"2023-02-28T17:21:09Z","comments_count":1,"comments_url":"https://www.regulations.gov/docketBrowser?rpp=50&so=DESC&sb=postedDate&po=0&dct=PS&D=VA-2022-VACO-0001","docket_id":"VA-2022-VACO-0001","document_id":"VA-2022-VACO-0001-0156","regulation_id_number":null,"supporting_documents":[],"supporting_documents_count":0,"title":"Notices Requesting Comments"},"regulations_dot_gov_url":null,"significant":null,"signing_date":null,"start_page":19177,"subtype":null,"title":"Privacy Act of 1974; Matching Program","toc_doc":"Privacy Act; Matching Program","toc_subject":null,"topics":[],"type":"Notice","volume":87}